    "reason": "[ev-d29ce67c9aa8] lists only a revert of PR #20981 (graceful shutdown for the API server). The revert PR [ev-c8ffbd25b5c2] says the change was undone because it broke the Windows build and was \"blocking the 2.14 release\". That indicates the graceful-shutdown change was never in a released version. The revert therefore puts the code back where it was and changes nothing for users between releases, so it is not a behavior change to the API server's shutdown. [ev-36db2d7dc61b] and [ev-474be21313fd] show the revert simply removes the same files and edits that #20981 added.",
